  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equity Group Foundation Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Access to SME and rural population in agriculture using technolgy. The project will focus on encouraging women to participate in the program activities in the various parts of the agricultural value chain where women are a significant part of the labour force and should have better access to productive resources such as land, credit and education/training.</narrative>
  </description>
